Seeking Greenlights:  Yes

Page Type:  SCP Article

Genre (Optional):  Joke / Horror

Page Layout (Optional):  Image, containment procedures, description, experiment logs

Elevator Pitch:  2 anomalous entities designated SCP-XXXX-A and B. XXXX-A is a house, in which objects placed in it vanish after a couple hours. XXXX-B is a middle-aged woman living inside the house, who can summon any object upon request.

Central Narrative:  Researchers looking into possible uses for SCP(s) who can manifest objects at will. (This is planned, but not yet integrated.)

